  "taskSelection": "UI toast audit\n\nManual\n\nInstructions\n\nDisposable visual sample. Do not run.\n\nAssistant\nKel\nModel\nAutomatic\nExecution mode\nNew conversation\nQueue\nHistory\n\nNo runs yet\n\nGo to conversation",
  "newTaskDialog": "Create Scheduled Task\n Name\n Assistant\nSelect the assistant to execute this task\nExecution Mode\nNew conversation\nOngoing conversation\n\nEach run starts a fresh conversation, so previous context does not carry over. Best for recurring reports or checks that should stay independent.\n\n Prompt\n\nQueue protection\n\nWhen enabled, a new trigger is skipped while the previous scheduled conversation is still running, without interrupting the assistant.\n\nFrequency\nManual\nAdvanced Settings\nCancel\nSave",
  "exportDialog": "Export and issue report\nExport and issue report\nExport sanitized diagnostics\n\nThe export is built from an allowlist, not by filtering a dump: credentials, tokens and API keys, prompts, transcripts of unrelated conversations, personal files and environment dumps are excluded by construction.\n\nWrite local draft"
